    "upstream_findings": [
      "stored_session.go: lease2s; background lock-wait context; transient failures fall through validation then outer Clear; error wrappers erase types.",
      "session_state.go: Refreshed has msgpack:- and must not be serialized as a JWT verification exemption.",
      "oidc.go: createSession verifies returned ID tokens; current Refreshed skips subsequent JWT verification; reloaded session loses that flag and nonce-less refresh fails original-nonce comparison.",
      "provider_data.go: claim extraction used context.TODO and could outlive authentication cancellation.",
      "redis_store.go: Redis nil and Redis outage were untyped; ContextTimeoutEnabled was absent.",
      "requests/http.go: DefaultHTTPClient had no timeout; go.mod requires Go1.26.0.",
      "coreos/go-oidc v3.20.0 oidc/verify.go: exported TokenExpiredError is typed; signature/JWKS errors can erase underlying cause. Unknown verifier failures reject503 without accepting token or deleting the record."
    ]
  },
